y the use of the correct expressions, vocabulary and grammatical structures related to the communicative aspects for this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Describes common health conditions by the use of the correct expressions, vocabulary and grammatical structures related to the communicative aspects for this level."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Common Health Problems"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "What are some remedies or treatments for these problems in your country?<br>These are some common health problems:  "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":10,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Health Problem\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Stomachache\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A pain in your stomach\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Headache\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A pain in your head\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Earache\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A pain your ear\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sore throat\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A pain in your throat\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A cold\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A common sickness caused by a virus\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" The flu\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A serious sickness caused by a virus\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Toothache\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A pain in your tooth\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Backache\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A pain in your back\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Cramp\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A sharp pain in a muscle \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Should vs. Must to Talk About Solutions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the modal <span class=\"italic\">should</span> to give advice.<br>   <span class=\"italic\"><br>Example: You should get some rest.<br></span>  <br>You use the modal <span class=\"italic\">must</span> to tell someone what they have to do or need to do. It is very strong.<br>  <span class=\"italic\"><br>Example: You must take medicine.<br></span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "You should get some rest."}, {"type": "example", "content": "You must eat every day."}, {"type": "example", "content": "You should drink this tea."}, {"type": "example", "content": "You must take this medicine."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cramp"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a sharp and sudden pain in your body"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have bad stomach cramps."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le11ob10aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about remedies."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "remedy"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a medicine or treatment for a sickness"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My Aunt Nelly knows some remedies."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le11ob10aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "peppermint"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "leaves from a plant of the mint family"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You should try some peppermint tea."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le11ob10aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "ginger ale"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a kind of soda made with ginger"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You should try some ginger ale."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le11ob10aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "antacid"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "medicine to help stomach acidity"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You should take an antacid."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le11ob10aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to google"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to search for something on the internet using Google"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I googled stomachache remedies."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le11ob10aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "apple cider vinegar"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a type of vinegar made from apples"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I should take apple cider vinegar."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le11ob10aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "flushed"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "red and hot skin"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You look flushed."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le11ob10aud08"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le11ob10re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "With your partner, make a list of common health problems you know."}, {"type": "text", "content": " Make a list of possible remedies for each."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Compare your list with another group. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Discuss it with your group. Are they the same remedies? What is different?"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about health problems."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about remedies to health issues."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I give suggestions about heath issues."}]}], "type": "sena"}